Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jory Boy has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be able to get up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I lost the fight,\NFor some reason, I'm having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Joy Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's Joy Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.34,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what Sunisha said?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was starting to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Mr. Pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Mr. Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.84,0:01:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It is him. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So Kaido is lying after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me Big Bro is really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We sacrificed one of our best agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Kaido is furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I still prefer it to the alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We eliminated a risk factor like no other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:02:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Although we can't know for certain,\Nthis could have been a true disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We must seize the Gum-Gum fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For ages the world government\Nhas chased after it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and for ages it has eluded\Nour grasp. What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have allowed this embarrassment\Nto go on for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,800 years to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.70,0:02:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite vexing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds foolish, but it's almost as\Nif the fruit is trying to evade us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not entirely implausible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoan-type devil fruits can\Nhave a will of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's so, this fruit\Nwould be rather willful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.66,0:02:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, its true name\Nbears the title of a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Zoan human-human fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mythical type.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Model.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.20,0:02:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,From head to toe, his body was as\Nelastic as rubber itself, they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:03:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought and frolicked as he fancied,\Nbringing a smile to people wherever he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The warrior of liberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as others called him, Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sun God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the fruit's awakened power\Nis said to impart even
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,greater might to its holder\Nbut what it truly grants is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,freedom strength as broad\Nas the imagination the most
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,ridiculous power in the world\None that we could not contain
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki is here or in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved Odin too, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rethink this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido exploited me, but those\Ndays are all behind us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, pull out this nail!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help us both escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would listen to you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You think me a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My father, he kept his promise to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You told him that Kaido would leave,\Nthat you would free the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He spent five years playing the\Nfool and dancing as you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He never made a single\Nexcuse to his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He honored your conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he believed that you'd keep\Nyour word and set everyone free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So he withstood boiling oil for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He allowed himself to be cooked alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He always, always had a smile on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But the whole nation was taken hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was carrying that burden\Nall by himself in silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.52,0:05:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine the pain he felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Hiyori?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, are you okay with\Npeople talking bad about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I have you, my family. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I want to stay with you forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:06:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That Odin was one hell\Nof a samurai, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As shogun, I can give him a posthumous\Naward, or perhaps a monument.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the shogun's daughter, Kozuki Hiyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When you speak to me, mind your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when I was starving,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,even when I was dressed in rags,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I carried with me the honor that\Nmy father brought to our name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You have never been a\Nshogun a day in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a\Nthief and an imposter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lowly worm and a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And the longer you live your\Npathetic excuse of a life,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the more innocent people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lay a finger on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing me is pointless It still\Nwon't get rid of Tydo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have failed you, my task
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Contero, is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, I'm finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,my lord Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you're just in time Why,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a new stage for you right\Nbefore me Burn this bitch to death Go,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,my friend, and make it quick
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman who endured for 20 years\Nfails to get her revenge in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tragic comedy for\Nthe ages, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a relic of the Kozuki Kyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The strong like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We are blessed with\Nfortune from heaven itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.52,0:07:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you coming this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Konkuro, you imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.02,0:08:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Iori, you have to help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The dawn, it will surely come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.86,0:08:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki clan always\Nkeeps their promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do everything I ever wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, I think I can get back to the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, my heartbeat sure sounds funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my peak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everybody passing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we getting hit with Tom Curzaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's it coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,On the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:09:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. muscles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Muscles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And loop-dee-go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifth gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies for what\Nthat fool did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to win that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.54,0:13:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to settle this then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you full of surprises?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was certain you had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen your rubber power is affecting\Nthings outside of yourself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume this means your parametheon\Npowers have reached their awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But your body, the way it changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,it feels like something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost like you've gone\Nthrough a Zoan transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here, it's dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop eating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Muscle...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, turn out the lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like a shooting star!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Lucy Satori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shooting through your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.16,0:15:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Akainu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he flirting like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but he seems\Nto have put on weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's trying out a new form.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell is he doing this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's not made of rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure am having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see two lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, lift off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go make a game for a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.01,0:17:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This time I got an even better idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Home combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I even looking at right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Voice? He sounds just like Luffy.\NWhat you think that thing is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast! Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.06,0:18:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Despicable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehehe! Eh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror of three! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:18:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Agaraku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he certainly looks different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a damn comic strip?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You put on a good show, but it seems all\Nyour running around wore you out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.19,0:19:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your best isn't enough to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I got plenty left in the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I pooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.32,0:20:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Or halfway there, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder this wore me out so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can die in peace this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The story of the battle you fought\Nwill be passed down for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.10,0:21:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're dead, you're just bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.34,0:21:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,With those white clothes and that white\Nhair, he looked like a different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's back, but his voice is fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to give Wano a\Nhappy ending. Right, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,For Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.82,0:21:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,For Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.98,0:21:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.86,0:21:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't even be the first time today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:21:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat louder for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.26,0:22:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.81,0:22:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.04,0:22:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Ah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.16,0:22:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.38,0:23:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.66,0:23:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is completely insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.42,0:23:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.68,0:23:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This strange white transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom that seems to be\Nwarping the world around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.30,0:23:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Up here, up here! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.50,0:23:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're starting to get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Gump, gump, caribou!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.24,0:24:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like I'm playing games with\Na damn kid I'm sick of this crap
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.80,0:25:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't fun yet, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.22,0:25:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.14,0:25:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That was strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.74,0:25:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really funny too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.24,0:25:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.72,0:25:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what should I call that technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.40,0:25:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.26,0:25:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-gum-blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.46,0:25:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-gum-rah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.96,0:25:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.92,0:25:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.42,0:25:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.12,0:25:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joy Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.92,0:25:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How long it's been since\NI felt this rhythm?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Joy Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.16,0:25:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels as if you're right beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.46,0:26:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is dancing with excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.04,0:26:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot help but feel that\Nfate is at work. I cannot help
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.24,0:26:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but put my faith in this young\Nman You want to know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.14,0:26:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.68,0:26:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy The man who'll surpass you\NAnd then become King of the Pirates
